", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031360_1625427428185030_2711203823001816376_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F3WgpfpPitYQ7kNvwGNBenc&_nc_oc=AdqkIP2KL6KXBtO-2E2uKOUXmTAnW6AnhuPePqGW1iDkNdILepriLW5Jcz7Nb0htREI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af89kkdRC7CiI5It6CBRRphtl-P5YXLQziLGqTenoPi7lg&oe=6A2FFF6A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Lite.png", "id": "488641690876402", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974570_488641694209735_5817461652717182570_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s-E30xfytMkQ7kNvwEHiLEm&_nc_oc=Adog2DZ8dI9vRorntFu89ep9gI7mzxVd5SJ36XI9aA0kxe4SENm-pW7c2Rg8O52TonU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_HX2OvDyQlcCVLJtMgLta_i5E076PasAtLN2daCe9K5w&oe=6A30119E"}, "display_name": "Skillveri Aura MR Lite Welding Simulator", "keywords": ["Aura", "MR", "Lite", "Welding", "Skillveri"], "long_description": "The welding simulator trusted by industries, schools, and colleges is now yours to try ! Perform GMAW welding with Butt joint in 2G & T joint in 2F, on mild steel at 1/8 inches thickness. Progress through multiple difficulty levels and get your performance analysed with a \tdetailed scorecard. Please note that this is the Lite version of our simulator. If you want your school or organization to buy our fully loaded, feature-rich Pro version, write to us at sales@skillveri.com ", "short_description": "The welding simulator trusted by industries, schools, and colleges is now yours to try ! Perform GMAW welding with Butt joint in 2G & T joint in 2F, on mild steel at 3.2mm thickness. Progress through multiple difficulty levels and get your performance analysed with a \tdetailed scorecard. Please note that this is the Lite version of our simulator. If you want your school or organization to buy our fully loaded, feature-rich Pro version, write to us at sales@skillveri.com"}]}, "devel